                        "sense_id": "2abb7bf1-dd0f-3e80-b92d-ead5458a5062",
                        "entry_id": "f5aea981-d635-341a-8d62-b9d7cdd587a7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "to wriggle out; to get out; to get off; to escape"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial",
                            "figuratively"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "21152141-3076-4c55-9247-32d612ad21d1",
                                "sense_id": "2abb7bf1-dd0f-3e80-b92d-ead5458a5062",
                                "text": "— А, и вы попали, — с громким хохотом встретил Пётр Герасимович Нехлюдова. — Не отвертелись?\n— Я и не думал отвёртываться, — строго и уныло сказал Нехлюдов.",
                                "translation": "\"Ha, ha! So you are also trapped?\" he greeted Nekhludoff with a loud burst of laughter. \"You did not escape it?\"\n\"I never intended to evade my duty,\" sternly and gloomily said Nekhludoff.",
                                "english": "\"Ha, ha! So you are also trapped?\" he greeted Nekhludoff with a loud burst of laughter. \"You did not escape it?\"\n\"I never intended to evade my duty,\" sternly and gloomily said Nekhludoff."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
